{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dare to play this spooky game featuring a haunted San Francisco mansion plagued by accidents, ghostly figures, and a dark past. Prepare for the scare meeting suspects and apparitions alike, and face the paranormal atmosphere\u00a0with a supernaturally scary\u00a0seance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover who \u2014 or what \u2014 is behind the mysterious accidents in a house full of secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy Drew is invited, by a friend, to San Francisco to assist in the renovation of a Victorian mansion. But there are other uninvited guests, visitors from the past\u2013spirits who want the place all to themselves. Nancy suspects that there is another force at work: greed. In a house full of trap doors and secret tunnels, breaking glass and suspicious fires, one misstep and Nancy won\u2019t stand a ghost of a chance in Nancy Drew: Message in a Haunted Mansion!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/615770?t=1760008214","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760008214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760008214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760008214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Strategy guides and other resources available at </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dare to play this spooky game featuring a haunted San Francisco mansion plagued by accidents, ghostly figures, and a dark past. Prepare for the scare meeting suspects and apparitions alike, and face the paranormal atmosphere\u00a0with a supernaturally scary\u00a0seance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover who \u2014 or what \u2014 is behind the mysterious accidents in a house full of secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy Drew is invited, by a friend, to San Francisco to assist in the renovation of a Victorian mansion. But there are other uninvited guests, visitors from the past\u2013spirits who want the place all to themselves. Nancy suspects that there is another force at work: greed. In a house full of trap doors and secret tunnels, breaking glass and suspicious fires, one misstep and Nancy won\u2019t stand a ghost of a chance in Nancy Drew: Message in a Haunted Mansion!</p>","developers":["HeR Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615770/header.jpg?t=1760008214","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2001 Her Interactive, Inc. HER INTERACTIVE, the HER INTERACTIVE logo and DARE TO PLAY are trademarks of Her Interactive, Inc.  NANCY DREW is a registered trademark of Simon & Schuster, Inc.  Licensed by permission of Simon & Schuster, Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/615770/152426053/a50d0019c163a40f4500df398203e8bc927cf68c/1760007868/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760008209","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/615770/152426053/a50d0019c163a40f4500df398203e8bc927cf68c/1760007868/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760008209","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/615770/152426053/a50d0019c163a40f4500df398203e8bc927cf68c/1760007868/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760008209","id":257214776,"name":"Dare To Play Message In A Haunted Mansion","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214776/1e8505cd455e987fd